# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Auto News Video — Environment Configuration
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your real API keys.
# .env.local is gitignored — never commit real keys.

# ── TTS Provider ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Choose ONE: "edge-tts", "lucylab", "elevenlabs", "vbee", "vieneu" or "vieneu-local"
# - edge-tts     : Microsoft Edge online TTS (FREE, no API key required, supports VN & SRT)
# - lucylab      : Vietnamese voice cloning (recommended for VN content), free SRT
# - elevenlabs   : multilingual, more voice options, higher quality but pricier
# - vbee         : Vietnamese TTS (https://vbee.vn), async polling model
# - vieneu       : VieNeu Cloud API (https://vieneu.io), natural VN voice + cloning, sync mp3
# - vieneu-local : VieNeu on-device SDK (FREE, offline, needs `pip install vieneu` + espeak)
TTS_PROVIDER=edge-tts

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPTION 1: Edge TTS (Free - Microsoft Edge TTS via edge-tts-universal)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# No API key required.
# Vietnamese voices available:
# - vi-VN-HoaiMyNeural (Female)
# - vi-VN-NamMinhNeural (Male  - default)
EDGE_TTS_VOICE=vi-VN-NamMinhNeural
EDGE_TTS_RATE=+0%
EDGE_TTS_PITCH=+0Hz
EDGE_TTS_VOLUME=+0%

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPTION 2: LucyLab.io  (https://lucylab.io)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Required when TTS_PROVIDER=lucylab
VIETNAMESE_API_KEY=sk_live_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
VIETNAMESE_VOICEID=22charvoiceiduuidhere

# Optional overrides
LUCYLAB_ENDPOINT=https://api.lucylab.io/json-rpc
LUCYLAB_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=2000
LUCYLAB_POLL_TIMEOUT_MS=120000

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPTION 3: ElevenLabs  (https://elevenlabs.io)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Required when TTS_PROVIDER=elevenlabs
# Get API key at:  https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
# Browse voices at: https://elevenlabs.io/app/voice-library
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=sk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL

# Optional model override (default: eleven_multilingual_v2 — supports Vietnamese)
# Other options: eleven_turbo_v2_5 (fastest), eleven_multilingual_v2 (best quality)
ELEVENLABS_MODEL_ID=eleven_multilingual_v2
ELEVENLABS_ENDPOINT=https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPTION 4: Vbee  (https://vbee.vn)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Required when TTS_PROVIDER=vbee
# Register at https://vbee.vn to get your app_id and access_token.
VBEE_APP_ID=your_app_id
VBEE_ACCESS_TOKEN=your_access_token

# Optional overrides
VBEE_VOICE_CODE=n_hanoi_male_protrainer_education_vc
VBEE_SPEED_RATE=1.0
VBEE_ENDPOINT=https://vbee.vn/api/v1
VBEE_POLL_INTERVAL_MS=2000
VBEE_POLL_TIMEOUT_MS=60000

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPTION 5: VieNeu  (https://vieneu.io)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Required when TTS_PROVIDER=vieneu
# Get API key at: https://www.vieneu.io/#/developer (free 7-day trial grant for new accounts)
# Browse voices at: https://api.vieneu.io/api/v1/voices?engine=v4 (public, no key needed)
VIENEU_API_KEY=vn_sk_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# Optional overrides
VIENEU_VOICE=Ngọc Lan
VIENEU_MODEL=vieneu-v4
VIENEU_ENDPOINT=https://api.vieneu.io/api/v1

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPTION 6: VieNeu local — on-device SDK (https://docs.vieneu.io)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# No API key needed. Fully offline after setup. ~8s/scene on Apple Silicon.
# One-time setup:
#   brew install espeak                              # phonemizer (macOS)
#   pip install vieneu --extra-index-url https://abetlen.github.io/llama-cpp-python/whl/metal/
# Model weights (~2GB) auto-download from HuggingFace on first synthesis.
# If synthesis fails with an ONNX "external data path" error, materialize the
# HF cache symlinks into real files:
#   for d in ~/.cache/huggingface/hub/models--pnnbao-ump--VieNeu-TTS-*/snapshots/*/; do
#     (cd "$d" && find . -type l -exec sh -c 't="$1"; s=$(readlink -f "$t"); rm "$t" && cp "$s" "$t"' _ {} \;)
#   done
#
# Optional overrides (all have working defaults — uncomment to change)
# VIENEU_LOCAL_VOICE=Minh Quân Pro
# VIENEU_LOCAL_MODE=v3nano          # faster on weak CPUs (24kHz, lower quality)
# VIENEU_LOCAL_PRECISION=int8       # ~1.6x faster, needs CPU with VNNI
# VIENEU_LOCAL_PYTHON=python3       # path to interpreter with `vieneu` installed
# VIENEU_LOCAL_TIMEOUT_MS=300000

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TikTok follow card (outro)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Customize the TikTok-style profile card that appears at the end of every video.
# All fields optional — neutral defaults work out of the box, override with your own.
# Can also be overridden per-run: npm run pipeline -- script.json --handle @mybrand
# Set TIKTOK_BRANDING=false (or pass --no-branding) to hide the card + handle entirely.
TIKTOK_DISPLAY_NAME=Tin Tức 24h
TIKTOK_HANDLE=@tintuc24h
TIKTOK_FOLLOWERS=1.2M followers
TIKTOK_BRANDING=true

# Optional: URL to your real TikTok avatar image (jpg/png, square, ~256x256+).
# If not set, uses the bundled default avatar at assets/avatar.jpg.
# You can also replace assets/avatar.jpg directly with your own image.
# TIKTOK_AVATAR_URL=https://example.com/your-avatar.jpg

# ── Pipeline tuning ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TTS_CONCURRENCY: Concurrency limit for TTS generation (e.g. 1-3)
TTS_CONCURRENCY=1

# ── Render tuning ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RENDER_QUALITY: draft (fast preview ~3x, for checking layout) | standard | high
RENDER_QUALITY=standard
# VIDEO_FPS: 24 | 30 | 60. 24 renders faster + smaller file, still smooth for news.
VIDEO_FPS=30
# RENDER_WORKERS: parallel Chrome workers (0 = auto). Raise if you have RAM to spare.
RENDER_WORKERS=0
# VIDEO_CRF: encoder quality for the raw video.mp4 (lower = bigger/better, 18-28).
# Unset = hyperframes default. Set e.g. 23 to shrink the raw file directly.
# VIDEO_CRF=23

# ── TikTok upload copy ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# After render, auto-transcode video.mp4 → video.tiktok.mp4 (upload this one).
# TIKTOK_CRF=28 gives ~5-8MB for 30s 1080x1920 (vs ~98MB raw) with yuv420p + faststart.
TIKTOK_COMPRESS=true
TIKTOK_CRF=28

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Visual theme
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Choose ONE: "dark-neon" (default) or "light-pro"
# - dark-neon : navy/cyan/purple, glow effects — original look
# - light-pro : white/slate/indigo, clean corporate look, no neon/grain
# Each channel/brand can pin its own value in a separate .env if desired.
VIDEO_THEME=dark-neon
